  "priceBasis": "R1/R5 重推（探针 tools/probe-rules-a.mjs a2/a3：青灯酒馆同类食物供给47、需求28，稀缺度28/47=0.596，不再钳在0.5地板）。lodging gives standing1, so bread base2 * scarcity.596 * relation.99895 = 1.19, trunc once to1 (旧：scarcity.5 -> .99895 -> 0). Edited two-unit bill trunc(2*2*.596*.99895)=trunc(2.38)=2 (旧：1). Upgrade second buy: 2*.596*(1+.2/126)*.9979 = 1.19 -> 1 (旧：<1 -> 0). Reconcile 173/172; upgrade173. Grade/corrections1."
